{"id": "g3_merge_windows_gap_at_most_one", "signature": "solve(windows)", "statement": "`windows` is a list of [start, end] pairs of integers describing HALF-OPEN intervals [start, end). Windows with start >= end are empty and are dropped. The remaining windows are sorted by start and merged greedily: a window joins the current merged window when its start is at most the current merged end plus 1 (so a gap of at most one time unit is bridged). For example [1, 3) and [4, 6) merge into [1, 6), while [1, 3) and [5, 6) stay separate. Return the merged windows as a list of [start, end] lists sorted by start, and return [] when no non-empty window remains. The input list must not be modified.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[5, 5]]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [4, 6]]], "expected": [[1, 6]]}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [5, 6]]], "expected": [[1, 3], [5, 6]]}, {"args": [[[6, 8], [1, 3], [2, 4]]], "expected": [[1, 4], [6, 8]]}, {"args": [[[1, 3], [3, 5]]], "expected": [[1, 5]]}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [2, 4], [1, 1]]], "expected": [[1, 4]]}, {"args": [[[0, 2], [3, 4], [6, 7]]], "expected": [[0, 4], [6, 7]]}, {"args": [[[4, 9], [0, 1], [1, 2], [2, 3]]], "expected": [[0, 9]]}, {"args": [[[7, 2], [3, 3]]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[0, 10], [2, 3]]], "expected": [[0, 10]]}, {"args": [[[4, 22], [15, 2]]], "expected": [[4, 22]]}, {"args": [[[13, 23], [22, 22], [17, 22]]], "expected": [[13, 23]]}, {"args": [[[20, 9]]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[19, 2], [8, 3], [12, 20]]], "expected": [[12, 20]]}, {"args": [[[14, 21], [0, 25], [10, 8]]], "expected": [[0, 25]]}, {"args": [[[2, 5]]], "expected": [[2, 5]]}, {"args": [[[25, 19], [8, 0], [19, 17], [4, 3], [3, 8], [5, 24]]], "expected": [[3, 24]]}], "facts": [["arg", "windows", "interval_list"], ["iterate", "windows"], ["ask", "merge_intervals"], ["interval_ends", "half_open"], ["interval_gap", "2"], ["size", "windows", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["interval_scan"], "uses": ["interval_merge"], "solution_sha256": "043c1f47a67ba78cd559033ca7d778ba71b2bcf27276cd9f305f647521b35f6e", "reference_sha256": "cbea20fd205f9d32f7a5c4c2c1d67e3dca24aa1839fec68db253f7d65c0c058a"}}